# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — autotools Makefile.am relative include paths
# require in-source conan layout on OHOS
# Software: shine 3.1.1
# Gate: conan-verify G2 (conan create, ohos-aarch64) — fixed after layout change
# Status: DRAFT

id: DRAFT-shine-3.1.1-autotools-in-source-relative-include
status: draft
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-shine-3.1.1-autotools-in-source-relative-include.md
severity: 3
category: build-system|conan|autotools|packaging
trigger_tool: conan|make|clang
phase: compilation

keywords: autotools, Makefile.am, -I, relative include, in-source, build_folder, source_folder, basic_layout, layer3.h not found, subdir-objects, conan layout
error_signature: '[A-Za-z0-9_/-]+\.c:[0-9]+:[0-9]+: fatal error: '.*\.h' file not found|no such file or directory.*-Isrc|fatal error: .*file not found.*autotools'
match_keywords: basic_layout, src_folder, build_folder, out-of-source, Makefile.am, subdir-objects, relative include path, -Isrc, undefined include, autotools, conan 2

root_cause: |
  Conan 2 的 `basic_layout(self)`（含 `src_folder="."` 变体）默认把 build_folder
  与 source_folder 分离（如 build-release/）。autotools 项目的 Makefile.am 常写
  相对源码根的 include 路径（如 `shineenc_CFLAGS = -Isrc/lib`），automake VPATH
  构建/OoO 模式下该相对路径相对 **build 目录** 解析，源码根下的 src/lib 找不到，
  编译报 `fatal error: 'layer3.h' file not found`（configure 阶段一切正常，
  错误只在 make 编译子目录源文件时出现）。同一问题也影响 `-I../lib`、
  `-I$(srcdir)/...` 之外的裸相对路径写法。

affected_scope: 所有 Makefile.am 使用相对源码根 include 路径（-Isrc/lib 风格）且
  在 Conan 2 下用 Autotools helper 构建的 autotools 包；OoO 对其不生效的
  VPATH 不安全 Makefile。纯库（无子目录源文件引用父目录头）或显式
  -I$(srcdir) 的项目不受影响。

rec_approach: autotools-in-source-layout
rec_description: |
  当 Makefile.am 含相对源码根的 include 路径（-Isrc/...、-I../...）时，配方
  layout() 必须强制 in-source 构建，把 build 目录与源码目录合一：
      def layout(self):
          self.folders.source = "."
          self.folders.build = "."
  不要用 basic_layout(self, src_folder=".") —— 它仍会在源码下创建
  build-release/ 等分离 build 目录（OoO），相对 -I 路径照旧失效。
  实测（shine 3.1.1）：G2 首错 layer3.h not found 的编译命令里 -Isrc/lib 相对
  build 目录解析失败；改为 folders.build="." 后 conan create 通过，test_package
  正常执行。备选方案：修改 Makefile.am 为 -I$(srcdir)/src/lib（需 patches/，
  且 R8 要求补丁最小化，首选 layout 而非改源）。

rec_commands:
  - "conan create archives/s/shine/3.1.1 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing"
  - "# layout() 内：self.folders.source = '.'; self.folders.build = '.'"

verification: |
  conan-verify shine 3.1.1（ohos-aarch64, clang 15）G2 PASS：configure 成功后
  make 编译 src/bin/shineenc 时 -Isrc/lib 找到 layer3.h，libshine 库与 shineenc
  CLI 全部产出，test_package 消费者测试通过。

related:
  - knowledge/graph/E392.kv (raw makefile build_folder vs source_folder 概念相近)
  - knowledge/graph/E340.kv (basic_layout + cargo target 产物定位)
  - archives/s/shine/3.1.1/conanfile.py (layout() 落地方案)
last_updated: 2026-09-17